---
import SectionIntro from "../ui/SectionIntro.astro";
---

<section class="section process">
  <div class="shell">
    <SectionIntro
      eyebrow="From agents to systems"
      title="Individual decisions become system outcomes."
      description="TER extends the same agent centered architecture to interacting agents. Their actions can change the information, incentives, constraints, and opportunities faced by others, producing outcomes that no single agent determines alone."
    />

    <div class="process-layout">
      <div class="dial" data-reveal aria-hidden="true">
        <img class="agent-graph" src="/images/ter-organic-network-mesh-square.svg" alt="" />
      </div>

      <ol>
        <li data-reveal>
          <span>01</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Agents affect one another</h3>
            <p>
              One agent's actions can change the information, incentives,
              constraints, or feasible actions available to other agents.
            </p>
            <small>Interaction</small>
          </div>
        </li>

        <li data-reveal>
          <span>02</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Interactions produce system outcomes</h3>
            <p>
              Multiple agent decisions interact with prevailing conditions and
              external effects to produce market and system level outcomes.
            </p>
            <small>System outcomes</small>
          </div>
        </li>

        <li data-reveal>
          <span>03</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Outcomes reshape future decisions</h3>
            <p>
              Prices, institutions, constraints, information, and other
              conditions can change, influencing what agents do next.
            </p>
            <small>Feedback</small>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .process {
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .process-layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 0.8fr 1.2fr;
    gap: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 8rem);
    align-items: center;
    margin-top: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 7rem);
  }

  .agent-graph {
  width: 115%;
  max-width: none;
  transform: translateX(-6.5%);
}

  .dial {
    position: relative;
    width: min(100%, 29rem);
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    margin: auto;
  }

  .agent-graph {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    overflow: visible;
  }

  .edge {
    stroke: var(--line);
    stroke-width: 1.2;
  }

  .edge-contrib {
    stroke: color-mix(in srgb, var(--muted) 55%, var(--line));
    stroke-width: 1.4;
  }

  .node {
    fill: var(--surface);
    stroke: var(--line);
    stroke-width: 2;
  }

  .node-accent {
    fill: var(--accent);
    stroke: var(--accent);
  }

  .node-violet {
    fill: var(--violet);
    stroke: var(--violet);
  }

  .node-orange {
    fill: var(--orange);
    stroke: var(--orange);
  }

  .core {
    fill: var(--ink);
  }

  .core-label {
    fill: var(--bg);
    font-size: 8px;
    font-weight: 750;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .process-layout ol {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .process-layout li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 3rem 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    padding: 1.8rem 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .process-layout li:last-child {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .process-layout li > span {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .process-layout li p {
    max-width: 36rem;
    margin: 0.8rem 0 1rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .process-layout li small {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-weight: 650;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .process-layout {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .dial {
      width: min(88vw, 24rem);
    }
  }
</style>